msgid "no project"
msgstr "بدون مشروع"

#. module: atmta_procurement_sourcing
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/atmta_procurement_sourcing/models/sourcing_event.py:0
msgid ""
"%(line)s has %(remaining)s left to source and this event asks for %(asked)s."
" Sourcing the same demand twice would put one requirement in two tenders, or"
" in a tender and an RFQ already sent for it."
msgstr "%(line)s متبقٍ منه %(remaining)s للتوريد، وهذه المناقصة تطلب %(asked)s. توريد الطلب نفسه مرتين يضع احتياجاً واحداً في مناقصتين، أو في مناقصة وطلب عرض أسعار سبق إرساله له."

#. module: atmta_procurement_sourcing
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/atmta_procurement_sourcing/models/bid_response.py:0
msgid ""
"%(vendor)s's submission is recorded as received on %(received)s, before "
"%(event)s was issued on %(issued)s. A bid cannot answer a tender that did "
"not exist yet."
msgstr "عرض %(vendor)s مسجَّل كمستلَم بتاريخ %(received)s، أي قبل إصدار %(event)s بتاريخ %(issued)s. لا يمكن لعرض أن يجيب على مناقصة لم تكن قائمة بعد."

#. module: atmta_procurement_sourcing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:atmta_procurement_sourcing.view_sourcing_event_form
msgid "Accept Late Bid"
msgstr "قبول عرض متأخر"

#. module: atmta_procurement_sourcing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:atmta_procurement_sourcing.view_sourcing_event_form
msgid ""
"Accept this late submission for evaluation? Your name goes on the record as "
"the manager who accepted it."
msgstr "هل تقبل هذا العرض المتأخر للتقييم؟ سيُسجَّل اسمك بوصفك المدير الذي قبله."

#. module: atmta_procurement_sourcing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:atmta_procurement_sourcing.view_sourcing_event_form
msgid "Acknowledge"
msgstr "إقرار بالاستلام"

#. module: atmta_procurement_sourcing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:atmta_procurement_sourcing.view_sourcing_event_form
msgid "Issue as Addendum"
msgstr "إصدار كملحق"

#. module: atmta_procurement_sourcing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:atmta_procurement_sourcing.view_sourcing_event_form
msgid ""
"Issue this clarification as a new tender version? Every invited vendor has "
"to acknowledge it."
msgstr "هل تصدر هذا الإيضاح كنسخة جديدة من المناقصة؟ على كل مورّد مدعو أن يقرّ باستلامه."

#. module: atmta_procurement_sourcing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:atmta_procurement_sourcing.view_sourcing_event_form
msgid "Publish Answer"
msgstr "نشر الإجابة"

#. module: atmta_procurement_sourcing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:atmta_procurement_sourcing.view_sourcing_event_form
msgid "Record Bid"
msgstr "تسجيل عرض"

#. module: atmta_procurement_sourcing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:atmta_procurement_sourcing.view_sourcing_event_form
msgid ""
"Record that the vendor withdrew this bid? The bid stays on file as evidence;"
" the invitation no longer has a current offer."
msgstr "هل تسجّل أن المورّد سحب هذا العرض؟ يبقى العرض في الملف كمستند، ولم يعد للدعوة عرض قائم."

#. module: atmta_procurement_sourcing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:atmta_procurement_sourcing.view_sourcing_event_form
msgid ""
"Record what this vendor's RFQ says now as their submission, received at this"
" moment? The bid is sealed once recorded."
msgstr "هل تسجّل ما يتضمنه طلب عرض الأسعار الخاص بهذا المورّد الآن بوصفه عرضه، مستلماً في هذه اللحظة؟ يُختم العرض بمجرد تسجيله."

#. module: atmta_procurement_sourcing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:atmta_procurement_sourcing.view_sourcing_event_form
msgid "Withdraw"
msgstr "سحب"
